# project_filamentation

Flexible, extensible simulation framework for propagating structured light fields in linear and nonlinear media, with built‑in support for “Hobbit” beams, asymmetric Laguerre–Gaussian profiles, and Spatio‑Temporal Optical Vortices (STOVs).

---

## 🔍 Overview

This package provides multiple propagation solvers and beam generators to model continuous‑wave and pulsed beam dynamics under a variety of conditions (paraxial, nonparaxial, underwater turbulence, Kerr nonlinearity). You can swap in different field profiles and numerically integrate via split‑step or ADI schemes.

